          {
            "category": "workaround",
            "details": "There is no upstream fix for the original, unmaintained decompress npm package used by these components (last release 4.2.1). The maintained fork, @xhmikosr/decompress, resolves this issue in versions 10.2.1 and 11.1.3, but is not used by any affected Red Hat component. As a general mitigation, only extract archives from trusted sources with the affected tooling, run extraction as a non-root user to prevent the setuid/setgid/sticky-bit issue from creating a privileged file, and verify that any symlinks or hardlinks produced by extraction resolve inside the intended output directory.",
